        <Entry Name="CathTerminalFile_1">REGISTRO SCANSIONI ARK [2103][br]---------------[br][br]Chun, Catherine [4 lug][br]Ivashkin, Nicolai [5 lug][br]Hill, Jasper [6 lug][br]Lindwall, Sarah [7 lug][br]Pedersen, Ian [8 lug][br]Wolchezk, Heather [10 lug][br]Sarang, Mark [12 lug] ((Suicida))[br][br]Progetto ARK sospeso durante le indagini di Strohmeier sulla morte di Sarang[br][br]Alvaro, Emma [29 lug][br]Reed, Imogen [31 lug][br]Meuron, Louise [1 ago] ((Suicida))[br]Davis, Jessica [3 ago][br]Strasky, Peter [4 ago][br]Grau, Nathan [5 ago] ((Suicida))[br]Komorebi, Maggie [8 ago][br]Masters, Nadine [9 ago][br]Hart, Vanessa [10 ago][br]Fourqurean, Keith [11 ago][br]Finley, Gavin [12 ago] ((Suicida))[br]Rogers, Baxter [17 ago][br]Josic, Chris [18 ago][br]Goya, Javid [19 ago][br]Krier, Astrid [20 ago] ((Suicida))[br]Koster, Alice [24 ago][br]Wan, Brandon [25 ago][br]Bass, Robin [26 ago] ((Suicida))[br][br]Ultimatum di Strohmeier: un altro decesso e chiude tutto.[br][br]Cronstedt, Dorian [29 ago][br]Fisher, Martin [30 ago][br]Jonsdottir, Vigdis [31 ago][br]Frost, Matthew [1 set][br]Konrad, Guy [2 set] ((Suicida))[br][br]Progetto ARK sospeso a tempo indeterminato.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CathTerminalFile_2">SCANSIONI IN PROGRAMMA[br]---------------[br][br]Defreine, Joaquin [? set][br]Strohmeier, John [? set][br]Thabo, Richard [? set][br]Adams, Jane [? set][br]Shankar, Aashish [? set][br]Daviau, Marishika [? set][br]Evans, Shawn [? set]</Entry>
